      "content": "the support lines don't really change the math though. they give you someone to talk to for twenty minutes but then the rent is still due and the interest on my cards is still growing. it's like trying to bail out a boat with a teaspoon while the ocean is just pouring in. there is no \"break\" from reality. it's just this endless loop of working to pay for the stuff i need to work. it just feels like the system is designed to keep us in this loop until we just... break.",
